#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__date
msgid "The date the leave of absence document was created."
msgstr "Tanggal dokumen cuti dibuat."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__expected_return_date
msgid ""
"The date the student is expected to return from leave and resume enrollment."
msgstr "Tanggal siswa diperkirakan kembali dari cuti dan melanjutkan pendaftaran."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__academic_term_id
msgid ""
"The single academic term during which the student is on leave. The leave is "
"only valid for this term."
msgstr "Satu periode akademik tempat siswa bercuti. Cuti hanya berlaku untuk periode ini."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__student_id
msgid "The student who is applying for a leave of absence."
msgstr "Siswa yang mengajukan cuti."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__active_enrollment_id
msgid ""
"The student's currently active (open) enrollment, shown for reference when "
"granting the leave."
msgstr "Pendaftaran siswa yang saat ini aktif (terbuka), ditampilkan sebagai acuan saat memberikan cuti."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' untuk menghasilkan nomor secara otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan dalam status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Jenis aktivitas pengecualian yang tercatat."

#. module: ssi_school_student_leave
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_student_leave.field_school_student_leave__message_unread
